[b]RGO - Synthesis[/b]

A standalone agricultural RGO overhaul designed for a more vanilla-friendly
playset. This version uses the vanilla EU5 map and location set as its base and
is intended to integrate Historical RGOs - Global and Just Goods. Just Goods
requires Community Mod Framework, so CMF is an indirect requirement. More
Locations is not a dependency.

The Phase 1 design aims to improve vanilla's generic fruit abstraction and
historically anachronistic RGO assignments while preserving RGOs as broad
economic representations. Synthesis agricultural changes are not implemented
yet. Fruits Expanded is not required.

[b]Required items[/b]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3602513956]Historical RGOs - Global[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3785316314]Just Goods[/url]
[/list]

Just Goods requires Community Mod Framework. Load the required mods in this
order, with RGO - Synthesis last:
[list=1]
[*]Community Mod Framework
[*]Historical RGOs - Global
[*]Just Goods
[*]RGO - Synthesis
[/list]
